OpenFAST (Apache License, Version 2.0)
  https://github.com/OpenFAST/openfast

  * integration/openfast/patches/ contains patches that MODIFY OpenFAST source
    files (the root and openfast-library CMakeLists.txt; FAST_AeroMap.f90,
    FAST_Funcs.f90, FAST_Mapping.f90, FAST_ModGlue.f90, FAST_Registry.txt,
    FAST_Solver.f90, FAST_Subs.f90, and FAST_Types.f90 in
    modules/openfast-library/src; FAST_Farm_IO.f90, FAST_Farm_Registry.txt,
    FAST_Farm_Subs.f90, and FAST_Farm_Types.f90 in glue-codes/fast-farm/src).
    The modified files remain under the Apache License, Version 2.0, and
    carry the upstream notices, including:
      Copyright (C) 2012-2024 National Renewable Energy Laboratory
      Copyright (C) 2017 Bonnie Jonkman, independent contributor
      Copyright (C) 2024 Envision Energy USA, National Renewable Energy Laboratory
    The modifications add the CableDyn mooring module (CompMooring = 5 and
    FAST.Farm MooringMod = 5) and are Copyright (c) 2026 Jae Hoon Seo,
    SMI Lab, Inha University.

  * src/openfast/CableDyn_Types.f90 is generated by the OpenFAST registry from
    src/CableDyn_Registry.txt; the generated file carries the registry
