    sub-model files they reference are not redistributed here.

MoorDyn (MoorDyn-C: BSD 3-Clause License; MoorDyn-F: Apache License, Version 2.0)
  https://github.com/FloatingArrayDesign/MoorDyn
  https://github.com/OpenFAST/openfast (modules/moordyn)

  CableDyn reads MoorDyn-style input decks and implements several published
  line formulations that MoorDyn also implements (for example the
  viscoelastic and Syrope axial models and the lumped-end-mass convention).
  These are independent re-implementations from the published equations; no
  MoorDyn source code is included in CableDyn. validation/scripts/moordyn_c_driver.cpp is a
  reference-comparison driver that links against a separately obtained
  MoorDyn-C build.

